-- Law 36/2024/QH15, Chapter III: Article 39(6) (revocation of the registration certificate and
-- plate), Article 40 (service life of motor vehicles), and Article 43(2)(c) (the registered
-- person stays responsible until revocation). Decree 67/2023 Article 11 ends the insurance
-- from the revocation of the registration certificate and plate; Article 4(5)(a) lets the
-- insurer refuse a vehicle past its service life; Article 9(1)(b)-(c) allow a term under a
-- year for a vehicle with less than a year of service life left or registered temporarily.

§ `Chapter III — Registration and service life`

§§ `Article 39(6) — the cases for revoking a registration certificate and plate`

