-- The cases of Article 39(6) other than the end of the service life, which Article 40 decides
-- below, that the registration record shows on the day it describes.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 39(6)
GIVEN r IS A `A registration`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A case for revocation under Article 39(6)`
`Article 39(6) — the cases recorded for revocation, other than the service life` r MEANS
    filter (GIVEN c YIELD `the record shows` c) (LIST
        `(a) transfer of ownership`,
        `(b) a re-exported, transferred or destroyed import, or an expired zone registration`,
        `(c) forged records, an unlawfully changed number, or an engine moved to another vehicle`,
        `(d) damage beyond use`,
        `(dd) scrapped, or lost, at the owner's request`,
        `(e) unlawful registration`)
    WHERE
        `the record shows` c MEANS
            CONSIDER c
            WHEN `(a) transfer of ownership` THEN r's `ownership transferred`
            WHEN `(b) a re-exported, transferred or destroyed import, or an expired zone registration` THEN
                    r's `a duty-free or temporarily imported vehicle of a foreign body re-exported, transferred or destroyed`
                 OR r's `registration term in a special economic or border-gate zone expired`
            WHEN `(c) forged records, an unlawfully changed number, or an engine moved to another vehicle` THEN
                    r's `records forged, or chassis or engine number changed unlawfully`
                 OR r's `engine removed to register another vehicle`
            WHEN `(d) damage beyond use`                          THEN r's `damaged beyond use`
            WHEN `(dd) scrapped, or lost, at the owner's request` THEN r's `scrapped, or lost and not found, and the owner asked for revocation`
            WHEN `(e) unlawful registration`                      THEN r's `registered or plated contrary to law`
            OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Article 39(6)(a), second limb: on a transfer of a vehicle whose plate was won at auction,
-- only the registration certificate is revoked; the plate stays with the vehicle.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 39(6)(a)
GIVEN r IS A `A registration`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 39(6)(a) — the transfer revokes the plate as well as the certificate` r MEANS
    r's `ownership transferred` AND NOT r's `the plate was won at auction`

-- Whether the authority has revoked the certificate, or the plate, by the day asked about. The
-- revocation is the authority's act, by the procedure the Minister of Public Security sets
-- (Article 39(7)); the record gives its date.
-- src:494 | 7. Bộ trưởng Bộ Công an quy định trình tự, thủ tục cấp, thu hồi chứng nhận
-- src:495 | đăng ký xe, biển số xe cơ giới, xe máy chuyên dùng tham gia giao thông đường bộ,
-- src:496 | trừ trường hợp quy định tại khoản 8 Điều này.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 39(6)-(7)
GIVEN r IS A `A registration`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 39 — the registration certificate in` r `has been revoked by` d MEANS
    CONSIDER r's `registration certificate revoked on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST x  THEN x AT MOST d

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 39(6)-(7)
GIVEN r IS A `A registration`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 39 — the plate in` r `has been revoked by` d MEANS
    CONSIDER r's `plate revoked on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST x  THEN x AT MOST d

§§ `Article 40 — the service life of a motor vehicle`

-- src:500 | Điều 40. Niên hạn sử dụng của xe cơ giới
-- src:501 | 1. Niên hạn sử dụng của xe cơ giới được tính bắt đầu từ năm sản xuất xe đến
-- src:502 | hết ngày 31 tháng 12 của năm hết niên hạn sử dụng.
-- src:513 | 3. Các trường hợp xe cơ giới không áp dụng niên hạn sử dụng bao gồm:
-- src:514 | a) Xe mô tô, xe gắn máy, xe ô tô chở người có số người cho phép chở đến 08
-- src:515 | người (không kể người lái xe), xe ô tô chuyên dùng, rơ moóc, sơ mi rơ moóc;
-- src:516 | b) Xe cơ giới của quân đội, công an phục vụ mục đích quốc phòng, an ninh.
-- src:517 | 4. Chính phủ quy định chi tiết Điều này.

-- Article 40 speaks of "xe cơ giới" (motor vehicles, Article 34(1)); a special-use machine or a
-- rudimentary vehicle has no service life under it.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40, 34(1)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40 — reaches` v MEANS
    `Article 34(1) — a motor vehicle` v

-- Article 40(3)(a): motorcycles, mopeds, passenger automobiles for up to 8 persons besides the
-- driver, special-use automobiles, trailers and semi-trailers have no service life.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(3)(a)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40(3)(a) — of a kind with no service life` v MEANS
        elem (`Article 34 — the kind of` v) (LIST `a motorcycle`, `a moped`, `a trailer`, `a semi-trailer`)
    OR  (    `Article 34 — the kind of` v EQUALS `an automobile`
         AND v's `built for` EQUALS `carrying persons`
         AND v's `seats, not counting the driver's` AT MOST 8)
    OR  (    `Article 34 — the kind of` v EQUALS `an automobile`
         AND v's `built for` EQUALS `a special function`)

-- Whether a vehicle of this description, not converted, has a service life.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(3)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` v MEANS
        `Article 40 — reaches` v
    AND NOT `Article 40(3)(a) — of a kind with no service life` v

-- Article 2(7): a conversion ("cải tạo") changes the features of a registered vehicle, or of a
-- used imported one, so that its type changes. `before conversion` is that earlier vehicle.
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:48 | 7. Cải tạo xe (sau đây gọi là cải tạo) là việc thay đổi đặc điểm của xe đã được
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:49 | cấp đăng ký xe, biển số xe hoặc xe đã qua sử dụng được nhập khẩu dẫn đến thay
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:50 | đổi về kiểu loại xe theo quy định của cơ quan có thẩm quyền.

-- Article 9(10): converting an automobile of another kind into a passenger automobile is
-- prohibited, save into a passenger automobile for defence or security. Article 40(2) still
-- says which service life such a vehicle has (finding R9).
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:258 | 10. Cải tạo xe ô tô loại khác thành xe ô tô chở người, trừ cải tạo thành xe ô tô
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:259 | chở người phục vụ mục đích quốc phòng, an ninh.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(10)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 9(10) — prohibits the conversion of` rv MEANS
    CONSIDER rv's `before conversion`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST b  THEN
            `Article 34 — the kind of` b EQUALS `an automobile`
        AND NOT (b's `built for` EQUALS `carrying persons`)
        AND `Article 34 — the kind of` (rv's `vehicle`) EQUALS `an automobile`
        AND (rv's `vehicle`)'s `built for` EQUALS `carrying persons`
        AND NOT rv's `a military or police vehicle for defence or security`

-- Article 40(2)(c): the conversions for which the rule after conversion governs although the
-- vehicle had a service life before and has one after.
-- src:508 | c) Xe ô tô chở người có số người cho phép chở từ 09 người trở lên (không kể
-- src:509 | người lái xe), xe ô tô chở người chuyên dùng cải tạo thành xe ô tô chở hàng (kể cả
-- src:510 | xe ô tô chở hàng chuyên dùng); xe chở người bốn bánh có gắn động cơ cải tạo
-- src:511 | thành xe chở hàng bốn bánh có gắn động cơ thì được áp dụng quy định về niên hạn
-- src:512 | của xe sau cải tạo.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(2)(c)
GIVEN b IS A `A road vehicle`
      a IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40(2)(c) — the conversion from` b `to` a `is one point (c) names` MEANS
        (    `Article 34 — the kind of` b EQUALS `an automobile`
         AND b's `built for` EQUALS `carrying persons`
         AND `Article 34 — the kind of` a EQUALS `an automobile`
         AND a's `built for` EQUALS `carrying goods`)
    OR  (    `Article 34 — the kind of` b EQUALS `a four-wheeled motorised passenger vehicle`
         AND `Article 34 — the kind of` a EQUALS `a four-wheeled motorised goods vehicle`)

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(2) — finding R9
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the vehicle was converted from one with a service life to another with a service life, which Article 40(2) does not provide for` MEANS
    REFUSE "the vehicle was converted from one with a service life to another with a service life, which Article 40(2) does not provide for"

-- src:503 | 2. Niên hạn sử dụng của xe cải tạo được quy định như sau:
-- src:504 | a) Xe có niên hạn sử dụng cải tạo thành xe không có niên hạn sử dụng thì áp
-- src:505 | dụng quy định về niên hạn của xe trước khi cải tạo;
-- src:506 | b) Xe không có niên hạn sử dụng cải tạo thành xe có niên hạn sử dụng thì áp
-- src:507 | dụng quy định về niên hạn của xe sau khi cải tạo;
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(2), (3)(b)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
GIVETH A `A service-life rule under Article 40(2)`
`Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` rv MEANS
    IF   rv's `a military or police vehicle for defence or security`
    THEN `no service life`
    ELSE CONSIDER rv's `before conversion`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN
             IF   `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` (rv's `vehicle`)
             THEN `the rule for its present kind`
             ELSE `no service life`
         WHEN JUST b THEN
             BRANCH IF     `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` b
                       AND NOT `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` (rv's `vehicle`)
                    THEN `the rule for the vehicle before conversion`
                    IF     NOT `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` b
                       AND `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` (rv's `vehicle`)
                    THEN `the rule for its present kind`
                    IF     NOT `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` b
                       AND NOT `Article 40(3) — a vehicle of this description has a service life` (rv's `vehicle`)
                    THEN `no service life`
                    IF     `Article 40(2)(c) — the conversion from` b `to` (rv's `vehicle`) `is one point (c) names`
                    THEN `the rule for its present kind`
                    OTHERWISE `the vehicle was converted from one with a service life to another with a service life, which Article 40(2) does not provide for`

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(4)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Article 40(4) leaves the service life of each kind to the Government, whose rules are not in the sources, and the year it ends was not supplied` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 40(4) leaves the service life of each kind to the Government, whose rules are not in the sources, and the year it ends was not supplied"

-- Article 40(1): the service life runs from the year of manufacture to the end of 31 December
-- of the year in which it ends. NOTHING where the vehicle has none.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(1)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` rv MEANS
    CONSIDER `Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` rv
    WHEN `no service life` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `the rule for its present kind` THEN
        CONSIDER rv's `the year its service life ends under the Government's rules for its present kind`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `Article 40(4) leaves the service life of each kind to the Government, whose rules are not in the sources, and the year it ends was not supplied`
        WHEN JUST y  THEN JUST (YMD y 12 31)
    WHEN `the rule for the vehicle before conversion` THEN
        CONSIDER rv's `the year its service life ends under the Government's rules for its kind before conversion`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `Article 40(4) leaves the service life of each kind to the Government, whose rules are not in the sources, and the year it ends was not supplied`
        WHEN JUST y  THEN JUST (YMD y 12 31)

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(1)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40 — the vehicle` rv `is past its service life on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` d
    THEN `the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources`
    ELSE CONSIDER `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` rv
         WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
         WHEN JUST e  THEN d GREATER THAN e

-- For Decree 67 Article 9(1)(b): the service life still to run on a day is less than a year
-- when it ends before the first anniversary of that day.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 40(1); Decree 67/2023 Article 9(1)(b)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 40 — less than a year of service life is left to` rv `on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` d
    THEN `the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources`
    ELSE CONSIDER `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` rv
         WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
         WHEN JUST e  THEN e LESS THAN `add years` d 1

§§ `Article 39(6)(d) and Article 43(2)(c)`

-- Article 39(6)(d), first limb: the end of the service life is itself a case for revocation.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 39(6)(d)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF `A case for revocation under Article 39(6)`
`Article 39(6) — the cases for revocation that have arisen for` rv `on` d MEANS
    IF   `Article 40 — the vehicle` rv `is past its service life on` d
    THEN `(d) the end of the service life` FOLLOWED BY `Article 39(6) — the cases recorded for revocation, other than the service life` (rv's `registration`)
    ELSE `Article 39(6) — the cases recorded for revocation, other than the service life` (rv's `registration`)

-- Article 43(2)(c): until the certificate and plate are revoked in a case where Article 39(6)
-- requires it, the person named in the certificate keeps the owner's responsibility.
-- src:630 | c) Tổ chức, cá nhân đứng tên trong giấy chứng nhận đăng ký xe tiếp tục chịu
-- src:631 | trách nhiệm của chủ xe khi chưa thực hiện thu hồi chứng nhận đăng ký xe, biển số
-- src:632 | xe đối với trường hợp phải thu hồi theo quy định tại khoản 6 Điều 39 của Luật này;
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 43(2)(c)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 43(2)(c) — the person named in the registration of` rv `keeps the owner's responsibility on` d MEANS
        NOT `Article 39 — the registration certificate in` (rv's `registration`) `has been revoked by` d
    AND NOT null (`Article 39(6) — the cases for revocation that have arisen for` rv `on` d)

§§ `Article 35(1) and Article 9(8) — the conditions for a vehicle in road traffic`

-- Article 35(1): a motor vehicle or special-use machine in road traffic must (a) have been issued
-- its registration certificate and carry its plate, and (b) have its technical safety and
-- environmental protection assured. A certificate or plate revoked by the day no longer counts.
-- Article 35(1) sets no condition for a rudimentary vehicle (35(5) leaves those to the
-- Government).
-- src:311 | Điều 35. Điều kiện phương tiện tham gia giao thông đường bộ
-- src:312 | 1. Xe cơ giới, xe máy chuyên dùng tham gia giao thông đường bộ phải đáp
-- src:313 | ứng các điều kiện sau đây:
-- src:316 | a) Được cấp chứng nhận đăng ký xe và gắn biển số xe theo quy định của pháp luật;
-- src:317 | b) Bảo đảm chất lượng an toàn kỹ thuật và bảo vệ môi trường theo quy định
-- src:318 | của pháp luật.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 35(1)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 35(1) — the vehicle` rv `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` d MEANS
        `Article 2(2) — the group of` (rv's `vehicle`) EQUALS `rudimentary vehicles`
    OR  (    rv's `registration certificate issued and plate fitted`
         AND NOT `Article 39 — the registration certificate in` (rv's `registration`) `has been revoked by` d
         AND NOT `Article 39 — the plate in` (rv's `registration`) `has been revoked by` d
         AND rv's `technical safety and environmental protection assured, as certified on the day asked about`)

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(8), 35(5)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the conditions for a rudimentary vehicle in road traffic are the Government's (Article 35(5)), and are not in the sources` MEANS
    REFUSE "the conditions for a rudimentary vehicle in road traffic are the Government's (Article 35(5)), and are not in the sources"

-- Article 9(8): putting in road traffic a motor vehicle or special-use machine whose technical
-- safety and environmental protection are not assured is prohibited; so is putting there any
-- other vehicle that does not meet its conditions. Fork F30: for a motor vehicle the first
-- limb alone applies, so a missing registration (Article 35(1)(a)) is not a breach of 9(8).
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:253 | 8. Đưa xe cơ giới, xe máy chuyên dùng không bảo đảm quy định của pháp luật
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:254 | về an toàn kỹ thuật và bảo vệ môi trường, phương tiện khác không đủ điều kiện
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:255 | theo quy định của pháp luật để tham gia giao thông đường bộ.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(8)
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle`
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` rv `in road traffic is prohibited, on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` d
    THEN `the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources`
    ELSE CONSIDER `Article 2(2) — the group of` (rv's `vehicle`)
         WHEN `rudimentary vehicles` THEN `the conditions for a rudimentary vehicle in road traffic are the Government's (Article 35(5)), and are not in the sources`
         OTHERWISE NOT rv's `technical safety and environmental protection assured, as certified on the day asked about`
